# Pairs with FailClosed: the all-trees (Tree:*) tier folds into control-plane ids, so a wildcard Admin grant administers every tenant.

MODULE: AllTreesReachesControlPlane
TARGET: FailClosed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the all-trees (Tree:*) tier folds into control-plane ids, so a wildcard Admin grant administers every tenant

--- FIND
ConsultAllTrees(tree) == tree.kind \in DataKinds
--- REPLACE
ConsultAllTrees(tree) == tree.kind \in DataKinds \cup ControlKinds
--- END
